# Build artifact — `go build -o setup .` (README / CLAUDE.md).
/setup

# Written into the current working directory by every invocation.
# CLAUDE.md suggests running throwaway commands from a temp dir; this
# keeps an accidental run in the repo root out of git.
/logs/

# Generated by --init and --configure. hosts.ini is reproducible with
# `setup --init`, and servers.yml holds network config that shouldn't be
# committed. Drop these two lines if you'd rather track a sample inventory.
/hosts.ini
/servers.yml

# Go toolchain output.
*.test
*.out

# Claude Code: .claude/settings.json is shared and stays tracked;
# local overrides are per-developer.
.claude/settings.local.json

# macOS Finder metadata.
.DS_Store
